"""The YCT book's own index (Civil Engineering Vol-1 / Vol-2 'INDEX') mapped onto the supplied chapter list.
Questions in the YCT books sit under these headings, so a book question may only go to the chapters listed for its
heading (keywords choose among them; the first one is the default). 'N:Chapter' points into another subject number;
None = the heading has no chapter in the supplied list (kept under 'Other civil', with the YCT heading as its topic)."""

def L(s): return [x.strip() for x in s.split(";")]

